  "body": "## Version 0.22 release\r\n\r\n## Release notes\r\n\t- Added copper effects library (Richard Turnnidge) (#53, #54)\r\n\t- Added Multiphase ADSR audio routines (Richard Turnnidge)(#49)\r\n\t- Added Stepped Frequency Envelope routines (Richard Turnnidge)(#48, #47)\r\n\t- Implemented C standard version of strcmp (#52)\r\n\t- Implemented several fixed/improved libclang routines (Zerico2005)(#46, #51, #50, \r\n\t- Fixed strcspn/strpbrk functions (#44)\r\n\t- Fixed return type for _isfinitef/_isinff/_isnanf (#45)\r\n\t- Added isnormalf (#45)\r\n\r\nThanks everyone for all bugfixes, added code and suggestions; much appreciated!\r\n\t\r\n## Release binaries\r\n| System                     | Image name                     |\r\n|----------------------------|--------------------------------|\r\n| Linux x86_64               | agondev-linux_x86_64.tar.gz    |\r\n| Linux arm64 (Raspberry PI) | agondev-linux_aarch64.tar.gz   |\r\n| MacOS Darwin arm64         | agondev-darwin_arm64.tar.gz    |\r\n"
